{
  "id": "1SA.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "Samuel 1 18",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chamnyet ne kichame Jonatan Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagoges inendet ng’alaljinetab Saul, konamgei sobondab Jonatan ak sobondab Daudi, ak kicham Jonatan inendet ko u sobondanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiimut inendet Saul betunoto, mata kochamji kwo ga kogeny, gotab kwandanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiiyomisgei anyun Jonatan ak Daudi, amu kicham Jonatan inendet ko u sobondanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiireek Jonatan ngoriennyi ne bo barak ne kiilaachi, ak kogochi Daudi, ak ngoriennyi ne koi, ak rotwennyi ne bo chok, ak kwangennyi, ak birenennyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng’etkondab Saul agobo Daudi, ak kocheng’ei kobar inendet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwa Daudi oldo age tugul ole kiiyokto Saul, ak kitebi eng’ ng’omnatet: ak kiinde Saul inendet koboi murenikab luget, ak kimieit kioto eng’ taitab bik tugul, ak eng’ taitab otwogikab Saul agichek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingobwanei ichek, koweeksei Daudi kobunu baretab Pilistindet, komong’ gotab kor eng’ nganasok tugul che bo Israel, kotienonu ak kourereni, kotorogu laitoriat Saul, kobirei sugutisiek che mengechen, eng’ boiboiyet, koboto tuguk che kibutei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitienjingei kobogorisiechoto kourerendos kolen,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eng’ betut ne kiisubi betunoto, konyonji Saul tamirmiriet ne ya eng’ kimnatet, ne kibunu Kamuktaindet, ak King’alal eng’ go ko u chi ne amei iywek: ak kibut Daudi ketubet eng’ eunnyi, ko u ye kicham koyaei betut age tugul: ak kitinyei Saul ng’otit eng’ eunnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitoorta ng’otit Saul; amu kile, Atoore Daudi kosore koit inat. Ak kiistoegei Daudi tainnyi konyil aeng’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiywei Saul Daudi, amu kimi Jehovah koboto inendet, ak kiga kobagakta Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiisto Saul anyun inendet eng’ ole mi, ak kiinde inendet koek kiptaiyatab elfut; ak kimandoi ak koweeksei eng’ taitab bik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitebi Daudi eng’ ng’omnatet eng’ ortinwekyik tugul; ak kimi Jehovah koboto inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingogeer Saul kotebyei Daudi eng’ ng’omnatet ne o, koiywei inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kicham Israel tugul ak Juda Daudi; amu kimandoi ak koweeksei eng’ tainywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Saul Daudi, Keero, cheptanyu ne o, Merab, agonin inendet itun: egu kityo nyiganennyu, ak iyai lugosiekab Jehovah. Amu kile Saul, Mamache kotwa eunekyuk inendet, ago ingobar inendet eunekab Pilistik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Daudi Saul, A ng’o ak nee sobondanyu, anan ko oretab baba eng’ Israel, kot aegu sandetab laitoriat? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago eng’ betut ne kita kigochin Merab Daudi cheptab Saul, kigochi Adriel Meolatindet kotun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kicham Mikal Daudi, cheptab Saul: ak kigimwachi Saul, ak kiibaibai ng’olyondonoto inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwa Saul kole, Agochini inendet, si kobiit koek mestet eng’ Daudi, ak si kobiit kobar inendet eutab Pilistik. Komwachi anyun Saul Daudi kolenji ne bo aeng’, Iegu ra sandet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’at Saul otwogikyik, kolenji, Ong’alal ak Daudi eng’ ung’ot, olenji, Keero, baibai laitoriat eng’ inye, ak kochamin otwogikyik tugul: noto anyun ko mie iegu sandetab laitoriat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwachi otwogikab Saul Daudi ng’alechato kogas. Ak kimwa Daudi kole, Ogeere ko kit ne ming’in eng’ okwek koek chi sandetab gab laitoriat, ago ane, ko a chi ne banan, ne sasat?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwachi anyun otwogikyik Saul, kolenji, Kang’alal Daudi ko u ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile Saul, Omwachini Daudi ko u ni, olenjini, Mamachei laitoriat kanyiok alak tugul, ago machei irirenik bogol che bo Pilistik, si kobiit keyaaktochi mugetut bunikab laitoriat. Ak kiibwati Saul kole si kome Daudi eng’ eunekab Pilistik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingomwachi otwogikyik Daudi ng’alechuto, kobaibait komie Daudi koek sandetab laitoriat. Ak kotom kogesgei betusiechoto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kong’eet Daudi kwo koboto bikyik, koba kobar Pilistik bik bogol aeng’; ak kiib Daudi irirenikwak, ak kogochi laitoriat irirenichoto tugul, si koek sandetab laitoriat. Ak kiigochi Saul inendet Mikal cheptanyi kotun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
